<title>CHINA: Trading in Guangzhou Shipyard suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Guangzhou Shipyard suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Guangzhou Shipyard International Co Ltd was suspended in late morning at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the shipping group gained HK$0.625 or 29.8 percent to HK$2.725 prior to the trading suspension. Volume was 14.29 million shares worth HK$37.84 million.</p>
<p>Brokers said speculation of a group restructuring fuelled hope of stronger future earnings and that boosted buying interest on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
